  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Discover the blissful beachside retreat of \"Waterside Wave\" in the charming Gulf Trace neighborhood. Situated just over 100 steps away from the pristine sugar white sands and emerald green waters of the Gulf of Mexico, this coastal gem offers 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and a spacious private swimming pool.<br><br>Nestled on the south side of scenic Hwy 30A, this inviting home welcomes you with comfortable furnishings and a family-friendly open-concept floor plan. The first floor features a generous living area with vaulted ceilings, a fully equipped kitchen adorned with stainless steel appliances, and seating for 5 at the bar. Enjoy meals in the dining area with seating for 10. The first floor also encompasses two king master suites and a convenient full-size washer/dryer. On the second floor, you'll find a third king bedroom with beautiful Gulf views and a private balcony overlooking the state park. Additionally, there is a bunk room with 2 sets of twin-over-twin beds and an adjacent bedroom with two double beds. A spacious bathroom is also located on this floor. Each bedroom is equipped with a flat-screen television.<br><br>Beyond its ample indoor space, \"Waterside Wave\" presents a comfortably furnished poolside sun deck and a spacious wrap-around porch where you can admire the captivating beach views that drew you here in the first place. The home offers limited covered parking but accommodates a total of 5 cars in the driveway/parking area, including a car charging station for electric vehicles. Entertainment is taken care of with a full-size ping-pong table in the screened area.<br><br>HELPFUL NEIGHBORHOOD INFORMATION:<br>- Gulf Trace is a Community with Private Deeded Beach Access<br>- Private Deeded Beach Access - Just Across the Street<br><br>TRANSPORTATION:<br>- EV Charger on-site<br>- Golf cart and bikes are not provided with this home.<br><br>\"WATERSIDE WAVE\" BED CONFIGURATIONS: (Sleeps 14)<br>- Master Suite, First Floor: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Walk-In Shower<br>- Bedroom 2, First Floor: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Tub/Shower Combo<br>- Bedroom 3, Second Floor: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Walk-In Shower<br>- Bedroom 4, Second Floor: 2 Full Beds, Shared Bathroom with Walk-In Shower<br>- Bedroom 5, Second Floor: 2 Sets of Twin-Over-Twin Bunks, Shared Bathroom with Walk-In Shower<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- 5 Bedrooms / 3 Bathrooms, Sleeps 14<br>- Directly across from the Private Beach<br>- Private Pool<br>- Fully Equipped Kitchen<br>- Full-Size Refrigerator<br>- Upstairs Porch with Gulf Views<br>- Complimentary Wireless Internet<br>- Full-Size Washer & Dryer<br>- Off-Street Parking for 6 cars<br>- Tankless Water Heater<br> <br>- HOA does not permit golf carts in this neighborhood. <br>- Pool heating available for $60/day. <br>- No pets or smoking allowed. <br><br>Important Note: Waterside Wave is located next to Eastside Wave. Both properties can be rented together for larger families.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
